                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">This is just an example of project generation for a simple pick and place assembly using a Compas Box Assembly.

Note: For a more detailed over view of how this is defined and the various assembly possibilities please review other example file listed below.
    - ex1_assembly_definition_and_firebaseupload.ghx</item>
                  </items>
